OL,3,GNEWSAFootball pitch approved despite
OL,4,Adisruption fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning permission has been granted
OL,7,Ffor a floodlit artificial football
OL,8,Fpitch and multi-use games area in
OL,9,FBrighton, despite more than a thousand
OL,10,Fobjections.
OL,12,FBrighton and Hove City Council voted on
OL,13,FWednesday in favour of the development
OL,14,Fat the Brighton, Hove & Sussex Sixth
OL,15,FForm College (BHASVIC), which will be
OL,16,Fjust over 50 yards away from the
OL,17,FBrighton Open Air Theatre (BOAT).
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
