OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFootball pitch approved despite
OL,4,Adisruption fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne BOAT trustee argued that noise
OL,7,Fdisruption, such as "whistles and
OL,8,Fshouting", might affect alfresco
OL,9,Fperformances and "threaten the
OL,10,Ftheatre's viability".
OL,12,FHowever, supporters pointed out that
OL,13,Fthe application did not represent a
OL,14,Fchange of use, the site already being
OL,15,F"an active playing field with existing
OL,16,Ffootball pitches".
